2026-07-27T08:42:47.8718050Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:42:47.8718451Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:42:47.8718835Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:42:47.8719374Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:42:47.8719788Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
